libnpupnp
------------------------------------------
The libupnpp library, which provides the C++ interface for upmpdcli and
upplay, used to rely on the venerable libupnp library (a.k.a pupnp: Portable
UPnP) to provide the base UPnP protocol functionality.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libcurl4-8.22.0-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libmicrohttpd12-1.0.10-1bl1
  libnpupnp-devel-6.3.0-1bl1
  libnpupnp13-6.3.0-1bl1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libcurl-devel-8.22.0-1
  libmicrohttpd-devel-1.0.10-1bl1
  meson-1.10.2-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://www.lesbonscomptes.com/upmpdcli/

Canonical download:
  https://www.lesbonscomptes.com/upmpdcli/downloads/libnpupnp-6.3.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libnpupnp-6.3.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libnpupnp-6.3.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libnpupnp-6.3.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libnpupnp-6.3.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libnpupnp13-6.3.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libnpupnp-devel-6.3.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libnpupnp)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libnpupnp.README
  /usr/share/doc/libnpupnp/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libnpupnp/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libnpupnp/README.md

(libnpupnp13)
  /usr/bin/cygnpupnp-13.dll

(libnpupnp-devel)
  /usr/include/npupnp/UpnpGlobal.h
  /usr/include/npupnp/netif.h
  /usr/include/npupnp/upnp.h
  /usr/include/npupnp/upnpconfig.h
  /usr/include/npupnp/upnpdebug.h
  /usr/include/npupnp/upnpdescription.h
  /usr/include/npupnp/upnptools.h
  /usr/lib/libnpupnp.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/npupnp.pc

